      "caption": null,
      "body": "খ) দেওয়া আছে, $y = \\frac{4 - x}{4 + x}$\nধরি, $f(x) = y \\therefore x = f^{-1}(y)$\nএখন, $y = \\frac{4 - x}{4 + x}$\nবা, $4y + xy = 4 - x$\nবা, $xy + x = 4 - 4y$\nবা, $x(y + 1) = 4(1 - y)$\nবা, $x = \\frac{4(1 - y)}{1 + y}$\nবা, $f^{-1}(y) = \\frac{4(1 - y)}{1 + y}$ [$\\because x = f^{-1}(y)$]\n$\\therefore f^{-1}(x) = \\frac{4(1 - x)}{(1 + x)}$ [চলক পরিবর্তন করে]",
